Excersise Tasks

Question 1

Given the employees table:Find all employees whose salary is greater than the average salary of all employees.

SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE salary >
(
    SELECT AVG(salary)
    FROM employees
);

Question 2

Given these tables:Find all employees who belong to departments listed in the departments table.

SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE department_id IN
(
    SELECT department_id
    FROM departments
);

Question 3

Using the same tables above,Find all employees who do not belong to any department listed in the departments table.

SELECT *
FROM employees
WHERE department_id NOT IN
(
    SELECT department_id
    FROM departments
);
